{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07000","headline":"送朱大出关 · 陶翰","name":"送朱大出关","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚客西上书，十年不得意。\n平生相知者，晚节心各异。\n长揖五侯门，拂衣谢中贵。\n丈夫多别离，各有四方事。\n拔劒因高歌，萧萧北风至。\n故人有斗酒，是夜共君醉。\n努立强加餐，当年莫相弃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}